:- Earlier planning assumed held-out transfer, second-core optimization, or harness ablations were required -> first establish whether the contribution is benchmark measurement or method superiority. [Task 1]\n192:# Task Group: HWE Bench GPT-5.6 benchmark integration and run operations\n194:applies_to: cwd=/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament; reuse_rule=paths/configs are checkout-specific and runner behavior should be rechecked before use; process/checkpoint safeguards remain high value.\n200:- rollout_summaries/2026-07-10T12-06-14-IIqv-gpt56_benchmark_integration_run_management.md (cwd=/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament, rollout_path=/Users/bonetto/.codex/sessions/2026/07/10/rollout-2026-07-10T09-06-14-019f4beb-d697-7f31-a3ac-0367c0a2db5b.jsonl, updated_at=2026-09-05T13:16:41+00:00, thread_id=019f4beb-d697-7f31-a3ac-0367c0a2db5b)\n206:## Task 2: Monitor, cleanup, and stop benchmark runs, success\n210:- rollout_summaries/2026-07-10T12-06-14-IIqv-gpt56_benchmark_integration_run_management.md (cwd=/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament, rollout_path=/Users/bonetto/.codex/sessions/2026/07/10/rollout-2026-07-10T09-06-14-019f4beb-d697-7f31-a3ac-0367c0a2db5b.jsonl, updated_at=2026-09-05T13:16:41+00:00, thread_id=019f4beb-d697-7f31-a3ac-0367c0a2db5b)\n230:- Verilator rejects glob ordering when `core.sv` precedes typedefs in `core_pkg.sv` -> enumerate RTL and place `core_pkg.sv` first. Do baseline lint/formal preflight before paid rounds; `sby` may fail `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'click'`. [Task 1]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
