egression\"\n24:\"id\": \"hyp-20260906-002-r8s1\"\n24:\"title\": \"Absorb ID operand capture into synchronous register-file RAM banks\"\n24:\"outcome\": \"regression\"\n25:\"id\": \"hyp-20260906-003-r8s2\"\n25:\"title\": \"Backward-branch prediction with validity-only EX annul\"\n25:\"outcome\": \"regression\"\n26:\"id\": \"hyp-20260906-001-r9s0\"\n26:\"title\": \"Flatten EX operand selection with direct one-hot forwarding\"\n26:\"category\": \"micro_opt\"\n26:\"outcome\": \"regression\"\n27:\"id\": \"hyp-20260906-002-r9s1\"\n27:\"title\": \"Register JALR targets in a two-cycle execute path\"\n27:\"outcome\": \"regression\"\n28:\"id\": \"hyp-20260906-003-r9s2\"\n28:\"title\": \"Backward prediction with alignment-independent EX recovery control\"\n28:\"outcome\": \"regression\"\n29:\"id\": \"hyp-20260906-001-r10s0\"\n29:\"title\": \"LUT-map JALR target bit one after operand forwarding\"\n29:\"category\": \"micro_opt\"\n29:\"outcome\": \"regression\"\n30:\"id\": \"hyp-20260906-002-r10s1\"\n30:\"title\": \"Split JALR forwarding from target addition with an operand register\"\n30:\"outcome\": \"regression\"\n31:\"id\": \"hyp-20260906-003-r10s2\"\n31:\"title\": \"Backward prediction with balanced EX comparison\"\n31:\"outcome\": \"regression\"\n32:\"id\": \"hyp-20260906-001-r11s0\"\n32:\"title\": \"Remove launch qualification from idle divider operand storage\"\n32:\"category\": \"micro_opt\"\n32:\"outcome\": \"improvement\"\n33:\"id\": \"hyp-20260906-002-r11s1\"\n33:\"title\": \"Decouple fetch from backend interlocks with a two-entry instruction queue\"\n33:\"outcome\": \"regression\"\n34:\"id\": \"hyp-20260906-003-r11s2\"\n34:\"title\": \"Backward prediction with asymmetric registered exit recovery\"\n34:\"outcome\": \"regression\"\n35:\"id\": \"hyp-20260906-001-r12s0\"\n35:\"title\": \"Factor multiply signedness into one product and one result selection\"\n35:\"category\": \"micro_opt\"\n35:\"outcome\": \"regression\"\n36:\"id\": \"hyp-20260906-002-r12s1\"\n36:\"title\": \"Retime writeback selection into a unified MEM/WB result register\"\n36:\"outcome\": \"regression\"\n37:\"id\": \"hyp-20260906-003-r12s2\"\n37:\"title\": \"Fetch-certified single-entry backedge prediction with registered exit recovery\"\n37:\"outcome\": \"regression\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
