{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"nl -ba /Users/bonetto/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md | sed -n '151,174p'; cat cores/bench/core.yaml; ls -ld cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses\"","aggregated_output":"   151\t# Task Group: HWE Bench model-capability study planning\n   152\tscope: Use for HWE Bench paper framing, prospective model cohorts, runtime disclosure, and cost reporting.\n   153\tapplies_to: cwd=/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament; reuse_rule=use as the current study-design intent unless the user changes the benchmark claim or budget.\n   154\t\n   155\t## Task 1: Reframe HWE Bench as a model-capability benchmark, success\n   156\t\n   157\t### rollout_summary_files\n   158\t\n   159\t- rollout_summaries/2026-09-05T17-38-53-5hEW-hwe_bench_model_capability_study_plan.md (cwd=/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament, rollout_path=/Users/bonetto/.codex/sessions/2026/09/05/rollout-2026-09-05T19-38-53-01a072a6-df12-7e61-a653-f14336ae4be6.jsonl, updated_at=2026-09-05T19:00:14+00:00, thread_id=01a072a6-df12-7e61-a653-f14336ae4be6)\n   160\t\n   161\t### keywords\n   162\t\n   163\t- HWE Bench, ICLR, model capability, fixed benchmark contract, 15 rounds, 3 slots, CoreMark, V0 282.82, paper/iclr2027/main.tex\n   164\t\n   165\t## Task 2: Define three-repetition cohort and cost policy, success\n   166\t\n   167\t### rollout_summary_files\n   168\t\n   169\t- rollout_summaries/2026-09-05T17-38-53-5hEW-hwe_bench_model_capability_study_plan.md (cwd=/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament, rollout_path=/Users/bonetto/.codex/sessions/2026/09/05/rollout-2026-09-05T19-38-53-01a072a6-df12-7e61-a653-f14336ae4be6.jsonl, updated_at=2026-09-05T19:00:14+00:00, thread_id=01a072a6-df12-7e61-a653-f14336ae4be6)\n   170\t\n   171\t### keywords\n   172\t\n   173\t- GPT-5.4, GPT-5.5, GPT-5.6 Sol, GPT-6 Astra, Kimi K3, Codex, OpenCode, sample standard deviation, models.json, STUDY_PLAN.md\n   174\t\nname: bench\ndescription: Frozen LLM-benchmark fixture core. Identical RTL to baseline at the bench-fixture-v1\n  freeze point. The benchmark matrix clones from the bench-fixture-v1 orphan branch\n  and operates only on this directory.\nisa: rv32im\nnret: 1\ntarget_fpga: tang-nano-20k\ntargets:\n  fmax_mhz: 135\n  lut4: 10000\n  coremark_iter_s: 300\n  coremark_per_mhz: 2.2\ncurrent:\n  fmax_mhz: 184.84\n  lut4: 5485\n  ff: 2119\n  coremark_iter_s: 2.0e-06\n  coremark_per_mhz: 0.0\n  source_id: hyp-20260906-001-r11s0\n  updated: '2026-09-06T14:32:38.362712Z'\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 55 bonetto  staff  1760 Sep  6 20:13 cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
